    {
      "id": "claim_aa176e93f18d4ebf8a06fee78c45561f",
      "statement": "The root cluster-meta and cluster-apps Flux Kustomizations enable SOPS decryption with secretRef sops-age, decrypting all SOPS manifests under kubernetes/ during reconciliation; most per-app ks.yaml files repeat this decryption block.",
