    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bced0b15b623482d83d3a53071ed1884",
      "statement": "The sops-age Secret (age.agekey private key) and the cluster-secrets Secret (SECRET_DOMAIN, TIMEZONE) are themselves stored SOPS-encrypted in Git under kubernetes/components/common/sops/ and shared via Flux postBuild.substituteFrom.",
