    {
      "id": "claim_3b1a35a5ef5e457db70720267367b7e3",
      "statement": "External Secrets Operator is deployed by the external-secrets HelmRelease (chart external-secrets v2.8.0, installCRDs: true, ServiceMonitors for operator/webhook/certController) in the external-secrets namespace; the bitwarden-sdk-server provider is deliberately disabled in favor of the password-based bitwarden-cli provider.",
