    {
      "id": "claim_4949040079d440f3988a52f598999c68",
      "statement": "The bitwarden-connect Kustomization deploys chart bitwarden-eso-provider v1.2.0 as a HelmRelease named bitwarden-cli, authenticating to Bitwarden using the SOPS-encrypted bitwarden-cli Secret (BW_USERNAME/BW_PASSWORD/BW_HOST; client ID/secret keys commented out).",
